{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg9vzaP5QF5wS9dUkHN7w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've identified that the #4295 guard incorrectly rejects Hijack whenever `Written()` is true, which breaks websocket libraries like coder/websocket that write a 101 status with no body before hijacking. The fix is to only reject when `size > 0`, so I'll start by adding a failing test case for this.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2394,"cache_read_input_tokens":35262,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2394,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e5468e97-7686-49d5-813f-7dff77ddf349","uuid":"674e0c91-3b2a-4cae-b1fe-4579762b14ef","timestamp":"2026-10-18T15:22:45.633Z","request_id":"req_011Cg9vza2kHj8wEGzd5X3nY","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":4,"thinking_display":"updates"}
