{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg9w2BCcetMyGj8PNpkGW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the bug, but the commit failed. Git has no author name or email set in this environment, and I didn't set one for you. The change is uncommitted in the working tree.\n\n**The bug:** the guard added in #4295 made `Hijack()` return an error whenever `Written()` was true. That includes the case where only the status line has been sent and no body bytes have been written yet. Websocket libraries like `github.com/coder/websocket` send `101 Switching Protocols` and then hijack the connection, so they broke.\n\n**Changes:**\n- **`response_writer.go`:** `Hijack()` now refuses only when `w.size > 0`, meaning body bytes have been written. I added a short comment explaining why, and changed the error text to `\"gin: response body already written\"`.\n- **`response_writer_test.go`:** new test case \"hijack after header write should succeed\", which writes the 101 status and then hijacks.\n\n**Checks:**\n- The new test case failed before the fix.\n- After the fix, `go test ./...` passes, and `go vet` and `gofmt` are clean.\n- The existing \"hijack after write should fail\" case still returns `errHijackAlreadyWritten`.\n\n**Changed behaviour:** the error message text is different. Nothing in the repo compares against the old string.\n\nTo commit, set your git name and email, then run `git commit -am \"fix(response): refine hijack behavior for response lifecycle\"`. I can also commit it once the identity is set."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":396,"cache_read_input_tokens":39148,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":396,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e5468e97-7686-49d5-813f-7dff77ddf349","uuid":"8df27629-93f9-4671-a35f-eae401236f8e","timestamp":"2026-10-18T15:23:07.996Z","request_id":"req_011Cg9w2Ayi5nW68cgYHNpqG"}
